ask great_grandparent("Alex", who)

TRUE:
  who = "Rowan"

  Because great_grandparent("Alex", "Rowan") is satisfied by:
    great_grandparent(x, w) if grandparent(x, y) AND parent(y, w)

  Variable bindings:
    x = "Alex"
    y = "Jamie"
    w = "Rowan"

  Proof:
    grandparent("Alex", "Jamie") is satisfied by:
      grandparent(x, z) if parent(x, y) AND parent(y, z)

    Variable bindings:
      x = "Alex"
      y = "Sam"
      z = "Jamie"

    Proof:
      parent("Alex", "Sam") is a fact.
      parent("Sam", "Jamie") is a fact.

    parent("Jamie", "Rowan") is a fact.

ask grandparent(who, "Rowan")

TRUE:
  who = "Sam"

  Because grandparent("Sam", "Rowan") is satisfied by:
    grandparent(x, z) if parent(x, y) AND parent(y, z)

  Variable bindings:
    x = "Sam"
    y = "Jamie"
    z = "Rowan"

  Proof:
    parent("Sam", "Jamie") is a fact.
    parent("Jamie", "Rowan") is a fact.

